<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Developer Portfolio</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card-bg: #1e293b;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --border: #334155;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .bio {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
      display: inline-block;
      padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .skill-tag {
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .project-card {
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .project-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .project-card p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .project-links a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-right: 1rem;
    }

    .project-links a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .contact-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .contact-links a {
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .contact-links a:hover {
      background-color: var(--border);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Alex Morgan</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">Full-Stack Software Engineer</div>
      <p class="bio">
        Passionate about building scalable web applications, accessible interfaces, and simple solutions to complex problems.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        <span class="skill-tag">JavaScript / TypeScript</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">React</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Node.js</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">HTML5 / CSS3</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Git</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Featured Projects</h2>

      <div class="project-card">
        <h3>Project One: E-Commerce API</h3>
        <p>A lightweight RESTful API built with Node.js and PostgreSQL. Features JWT authentication, payment integration, and rate limiting.</p>
        <div class="project-links">
          <a href="#" target="_blank">View Code &rarr;</a>
          <a href="#" target="_blank">Live Demo &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <h3>Project Two: Task Management App</h3>
        <p>A responsive drag-and-drop task board created using React and Tailwind CSS. Supports real-time local storage sync and light/dark modes.</p>
        <div class="project-links">
          <a href="#" target="_blank">View Code &rarr;</a>
          <a href="#" target="_blank">Live Demo &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Connect</h2>
      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="mailto:alex@example.com">Email Me</a>
        <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

</body>
</html>